### Reports run on HANA only
### Start with: cds watch --profile hybrid

@host = http://localhost:4004/report

############ 1. Usage by department and leave type ############

### Approved leave days by department and leave type, 2026
GET {{host}}/UsageByDeptAndType?$filter=year eq 2026&$orderby=department,leaveType
Authorization: Basic meera.iyer@company.com pass

### Same report for 2025
GET {{host}}/UsageByDeptAndType?$filter=year eq 2025
Authorization: Basic meera.iyer@company.com pass


############ 2. Leave balance per employee ############

### Entitlement, taken and remaining for every employee, 2026
GET {{host}}/LeaveBalances?$filter=year eq 2026&$orderby=department,employeeNumber,leaveType
Authorization: Basic meera.iyer@company.com pass

### One employee (Karan Malhotra, EMP012)
GET {{host}}/LeaveBalances?$filter=year eq 2026 and employeeNumber eq 'EMP012'
Authorization: Basic meera.iyer@company.com pass

### Annual leave only, lowest remaining first
GET {{host}}/LeaveBalances?$filter=year eq 2026 and leaveType eq 'Annual'&$orderby=daysRemaining asc&$top=5
Authorization: Basic meera.iyer@company.com pass


############ 3. Department utilization ############

### Percentage of entitlement used per department, 2026
GET {{host}}/DepartmentUtilization?$filter=year eq 2026&$orderby=percentUsed desc
Authorization: Basic meera.iyer@company.com pass

### Department utilization for 2025
GET {{host}}/DepartmentUtilization?$filter=year eq 2025&$orderby=percentUsed desc
Authorization: Basic meera.iyer@company.com pass

### Department utilization by leave type, 2026
GET {{host}}/DepartmentUtilizationByType?$filter=year eq 2026
Authorization: Basic meera.iyer@company.com pass


############ 4. Security tests ############

